rain
// Directions and placements the Lab Note example never draws
participant Doc, Alice, Bob, Zoé
(Zoé)-[admin(Zoé)]->(Bob)        : leftward root
(Bob)-[edit(Zoé)]->(Alice)         : leftward feeding leftward: over the top
(Alice)=[[edit]]=>(Zoé)            : rightward invocation
(Doc)=[[read]]=>(Zoé)              : unauthorised, so default placement
(Zoé)-[read(Zoé)]->(Doc)         : a long leftward arrow
(Doc)=[[read]]=>(Zoé)              : clamped: its power is labelled far away
alice-doc: (Alice)-[read(Zoé)]->(Doc) : leftward again
(Bob)-<revoke>-x[alice-doc]          : power arrives from the right
(Doc)-[read(Doc)]->(Zoé)           : rightward root
(Zoé)-[admin(Zoé)]->(Alice)      : Alice joins Zoé, leftward
(Alice)-[read(Doc)]->(Bob)           : through a leftward handle; Zoé has a combining accent
